=== num-radix-decode-percents
from: Cro::Core 0.8.10 lib/Cro/ResourceIdentifier.rakumod:11
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: radix :16
--- code
sub decode-percents(Str $s) {
    $s.contains('%')
            ?? $s.subst(:g, /['%' (<[A..Fa..f0..9]> ** 2)]+/,
                    -> $perseq {
                        Blob.new($perseq[0].map({ :16(.Str) })).decode('utf8')
                    })
            !! $s
}
say decode-percents('a%20b%C3%A9c');
say decode-percents('plain');
--- expect
a béc
plain

